  "data_quality_note": "Program Flash in MCS251 Source mode is 0xFF0000-0xFFBFFF; reset remains at 0xFF0000. Program size must not include the remaining EEPROM region. The experimental C++11 core profile is exposed at 12 MHz; exact-QEMU qualification is tracked separately. Clock options are conservatively limited to 12 and 24 MHz and must match ISP settings. The 19 logical port names represent 17 physical pads; P1.4/P0.2 and P1.5/P0.3 remain physical aliases. STC32G manual dated 2026-09-08, sections 4.3, 11, 13, 23, 25 and 26: enable classic SPI, 6-bit hardware I2C, advanced PWM, separate pull-up controls and WTST/CKCON startup. Default SPI SS uses bonded P1.2; P1.0 and P5.2 are absent on TSSOP20."
